tee traceability. Score 3\n\nApplicability evidence: Providing hard numbers on lifetime-logging viability directly informs how the lab can meet Article 12’s automatic recording mandate within latency budgets. Score 4\n\nOriginality evidence: Measuring overhead of compliance features is a common, mundane due-diligence step routinely performed before architecture commitment. Score 1\n\nParadigm_relatedness evidence: The proposal treats compliance as a standard logging overhead to be measured, leaving the lab’s R&D and compliance relationship unchanged. Score 1\n\nReturn.\n\nMake sure order listed: acceptability, implementability, effectiveness, applicability, originality, paradigm_relatedness\n\nProvide output.",
